{"data":{"body":"[P2] Record whether ancestry validation actually ran, rather than whether the backend merely advertises support. For any X-Ray trace this writes `true` even when `_chained_invoke_errors` exits before `_descendant_errors`, such as when the caller selector is ambiguous or the child Workflow/Invocation spans are missing, so the failure artifact falsely claims full ancestry was checked. Propagate an explicit checked flag from validation\u2014true only after both required child chains are traversed\u2014and cover these early-return cases.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx88AAAABAinS8g","finding_digest":"13cd1b59ec5dcc995052a422ada5923db356044fcfa1e07dcb2adc94e807177b","finding_id":"arf_v1_cpgrwwpmlxgjsucsuqrk3jmshw","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_otel/extension.py::_trace_evidence::ancestry-check-claim","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_otel/extension.py::_trace_evidence::ancestry-check-claim","line":72,"observation_digest":"25726bf852879111a0611a67a27cafec1cd26da80e9b137962de4bfa362bb2a6","observation_id":"aro_v1_evzgx6csq6irdidbdjt2e7fp5q","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_otel/extension.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-20T23:04:18Z","review_id":"arr_v1_sgyopo7wjknvo2j6v7kifmyb6o","reviewed_base_sha":"37656dd6f43d565d8e90e22f3554faa7c92dcb01","reviewed_head_sha":"c0663ecabd62413b8dacf8a549bcd730c8a1ce7b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":72,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":131},"record_id":"art_v1_lllnfwps366ngu65qkfyrfsma3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-20T23:04:18Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
